# Design system

Source of truth: `bakar-roast-handoff/` (design-system README, tokens.json, motion.md,
screens.md, component READMEs, prototype). Where this file and the handoff disagree, the
handoff wins. Look at `/dev/components` to see every component and state.

Cinematic and moody: ink grounds, cream text, one ember accent, film grain, condensed
uppercase display type. Design at 390 first, then 1440.

## Tokens (`tailwind.config.ts`)

- Colour: `ink` (DEFAULT #0B0908, `soft`, `raised`, `line`), `cream` (DEFAULT, `muted`,
  `faint`), `ember` (DEFAULT, `bright`, `heat`, `glow`). No other hue, ever.
- Band-aware: `text-tone-accent`, `text-tone-muted`, `bg-tone-accent`, `outline-tone-ring`.
  They read CSS variables that `[data-tone="cream"]` (set by `<Band tone="cream">`) flips to
  heat red / ink / ink. `[data-tone="ink"]` resets them inside a cream band.
- Radius: `rounded-card-sm` 16, `rounded-card-md` 24, `rounded-card-lg` 36. Buttons, pills,
  chips, stamp: `rounded-full`. Tailwind's own `rounded-sm/md/lg` are unchanged.
- Spacing: `px-gutter` (18 to 56 fluid), `py-section` (88 to 176 fluid), plus fixed
  `gutter-phone/desktop`, `section-phone/desktop`, `control` 56, `tap` 44. `max-w-content` 1440.
- Shadow: `shadow-glow-ember` (public pages only).
- Easing: `ease-expo-out`, `ease-expo-in-out`; `duration-800`, `duration-900`.
  In JS: `expo.out`, `expo.inOut`, `duration.default` from `lib/motion.ts`.
- Gradients: `.photo-gradient`, `.cta-gradient` (plain classes, not `bg-*`).

## Type (component classes in `app/globals.css`)

- Display (Bricolage at width 80, 800, uppercase, line height 0.84): `display-hero`
  (clamp 64 to 210), `display-xl` (clamp 48 to 128, section headlines), `display-lg`
  (clamp 36 to 80), `display-md` 48, `display-sm` 32. An `<em>` inside takes the accent.
- Text: `type-lead`, `type-body-lg` (public paragraphs), `type-body` (forms), `type-label`,
  `type-small`, `type-eyebrow`.
- Admin: `type-admin-title`, `type-admin-body`, `type-admin-meta` only. Display face only on
  admin page titles, tile numbers, date blocks and the payment headline.
- Use these classes, not `text-[..px]` font sizes, and not `text-display-*` (cn() would drop them).

## Components (`components/ui/`, named exports)

- `Button`: pill with arrow chip; `variant` ember/cream/ink/ghost, `size` default 56 / md 48
  (header) / sm 44 (admin, no chip), `loading` + `loadingLabel`, `href` renders a link, `block`.
- `Headline`, `Eyebrow`: eyebrow with dot + display headline, `size`, `as`, `tone`.
- `PhotoSlot`: frame over the ember gradient; `src`, `note`, `radius`, children = chips.
- `Pill` (aria-pressed, or `mode="radio"`), `Chip` (non-interactive, on photos).
- `StatusChip`: `status: CateringBookingStatus`. Fixed labels and looks.
- `Field`, `TextareaField`, `SelectField`: label, help, error, optional, `size` md/sm.
- `Banner` (error/ok), `EmptyState`, `Skeleton`, `ErrorMark`.
- `Dialog`: native dialog, controlled `open`/`onClose`, confirm (cream) + cancel (ghost).
- `AccordionItem`, `TipCard`: native details rows; ember-bright tip card.
- `Stamp`: spinning circular text; `text`, `label`, `tone`, `size`, `href`.
- `Marquee`: crossed ribbons, scroll-velocity driven; `words`.
- `Stat` (+ `useCountUp`): count-up number with ember superscript unit.
- `Toggle`: admin switch; `label`, `onText`/`offText`.
- `GuestStepper`: controlled headcount, clamps to `min`/`max`, typed values clamp on blur/Enter.
- `BookingProgress`: four fixed steps, `current`, back via `backLabel` + `backHref`/`onBack`.
- `Header` (+ `Wordmark`), `Footer`, `CtaBand`: site chrome and the closing band.
- `Band` (`tone` base/raised/soft/cream, section padding), `Container` (gutters, 1440 max).
- Ink surfaces only (hard-coded cream text): `Field`, `Pill`, `EmptyState`, `StatusChip`,
